@@section 1
@@title SQ-EX Exposure Extras camera bag ids through Common's swap list, 2026-11-17 ([exposure.md](../exposure.md) 8, design_rules V-06; TODO `conventions #23`)
@@date 2026-11-17
@@reviewed 2026-11-17
@@jars exposure creativecommon
@@sources development/exposureBackport/src/extras
@@text
@@text The hand `MissingMappingsEvent` in `ExposureExtras` is gone: `creativeengineering:<tier>_camera_bag` (before Creative Common 1.0.3) and `exposure_extras:*` are `replaces` entries in `data/exposureextras/swaps/owner_namespace.json`. Runs in boot 2 of SQ-RFX-25 (rows/RFX.qb section 6); the NBT alias half is SQ-RFX-27.
@@table
## SQ-EX-01 | camera bags written under the old ids load under exposureextras ids; no hand remap left
@group A (no old save)
@commands `> setblock 30 -61 0 chest{Items:[...]}` with `creativeengineering:iron_camera_bag` and `exposure_extras:leather_camera_bag` (each with a `CameraBag` tag); `> data get block 30 -61 0 Items`; `> give @p exposureextras:leather_camera_bag`
@pass the chest holds `exposureextras:iron_camera_bag` and `exposureextras:leather_camera_bag` with their `CameraBag` tags; the give works; no `[exposureextras]` remap line; no missing-registry warning for any `camera_bag`
@fails the bag gone: the `creativeengineering:` / `exposure_extras:` entries are missing from Exposure's swap list (Creative Common reads `data/exposureextras/swaps/`)
@absent creativeengineering:iron_camera_bag exposure_extras:leather_camera_bag (old ids written into the chest on purpose)
# r1118 R3 (2026-11-18): rewritten without an old save (plan_rowfix_r1118 section 4, owner ruling 1): a chest written with the
# old id in its NBT reads back the new id; placed blocks, entities and player data stay in the 1.2.02 upgrade section
> forceload add 16 -16 47 15
sleep 2
> setblock 30 -61 0 chest{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"creativeengineering:iron_camera_bag",Count:1b,tag:{CameraBag:{}}},{Slot:1b,id:"exposure_extras:leather_camera_bag",Count:1b,tag:{CameraBag:{}}}]}
> data get block 30 -61 0 Items
> pbot spawn ex01 32 -60 2 minecraft:overworld creative
sleep 3
> give ex01 exposureextras:leather_camera_bag
expect exposureextras:iron_camera_bag.*CameraBag|CameraBag.*exposureextras:iron_camera_bag
expect exposureextras:leather_camera_bag
expect Gave 1 \[.*\] to ex01
shell ! grep -E "[Mm]issing.*camera_bag|Identifier .*camera_bag.* is missing|\[exposureextras\] .*remap" logs/latest.log
> pbot remove ex01
> setblock 30 -61 0 minecraft:air
reject (Unknown (block|block type|entity)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded)
